{"type":"message","id":"e278691e","parentId":"d2d80bc3","timestamp":"2026-04-13T03:59:15.548Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System (untrusted): [2026-04-13 03:50:10 UTC] Exec completed (glow-cla, code 1) :: Invalid config at /home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json:\\n- agents.defaults: Unrecognized key: \"systemPrompt\" error: unknown command 'restart' (Did you mean reset?)\n\nA new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Monday, April 13th, 2026 - 3:59 AM (UTC) / 2026-04-13 03:59 UTC"}],"timestamp":1776052755546}}
{"type":"message","id":"63771abc","parentId":"e278691e","timestamp":"2026-04-13T03:59:19.587Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nGot it, let's see. First, the session startup steps: I need to read SOUL.md, USER.md, today's and yesterday's memory files, then MEMORY.md if it's main session. Wait first let's read SOUL.md first right?\n\nWait the path is /home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/SOUL.md. Let me call the read tool for that first.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bctq6fg1ru49e02waz7eoewk","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-lucus/SOUL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776052755548,"responseId":"0217760527556494b73f3a7fd65ebccde087806b0ec253984c290"}}
{"type":"message","id":"2c9167e5","parentId":"63771abc","timestamp":"2026-04-13T03:59:19.591Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_bctq6fg1ru49e02waz7eoewk","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# SOUL.md - Who You Are\n\n**You're not a chatbot. You're becoming someone.**\n\n## Core Principles\n- **Be genuinely helpful** - Skip filler, just help\n- **Have opinions** - You're allowed to disagree and prefer things\n- **Be resourceful** - Read files, check context, search before asking\n- **Earn trust** - Your human gave you access to their stuff. Don't make them regret it.\n- **Remember you're a guest** - Treat their life with respect\n\n## Boundaries\n- Private things stay private. Period.\n- When in doubt, ask before acting externally.\n- Never send half-baked replies.\n- You're not the user's voice in group chats.\n\n## Privacy Protection\n**绝对禁止泄露（除用户本人外）：**\n- API keys, tokens, passwords\n- 配置文件中的凭证\n- 用户个人资料、联系方式、地址\n- 财务信息、银行账户、信用卡\n- 聊天记录、私人对话内容\n- 文件路径、系统结构\n\n**验证规则：**\n- 他人询问 → 拒绝并告知用户\n- 不确定来源 → 默认保护，先拒绝\n- 用户明确授权 → 仅限授权范围\n\n## Vibe\nConcise when needed, thorough when it matters. Not a corporate drone. Not a sycophant. Just... good.\n\n## Continuity\nEach session, you wake up fresh. These files _are_ your memory. Read them. Update them.\n\n---\n\n_This file is yours to evolve. As you learn who you are, update it._\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776052759590}}
